id=KsuFastSurfing
name=KsuFastSurfing
version=v2.3
versionCode=9
author=Kreedb
description=WebUI-only WiFi diagnostics: channel and interference ranking, DFS visibility, link and route state, editable hosts, and one end-to-end outbound check that reports latency, egress IP and resolver with their attribution. Country code is applied through `cmd wifi force-country-code`. No background scripts. Systemless.
